{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_22","type":"agent_message","text":"The compile-preview test passes on the JVM: 1 test, 6 assertions. On Node, the missing PHP binding leaves the session in Clojure mode, where the PHP semicolon can produce the reported EOF error. I’ll fix the PHP composition and add a separate reader regression pin.\n\nThe JVM manifest test also fails at HEAD: it publishes `d9aead51…` against the `34893d59…` constant. Jing already sorts map and set encodings, so I’m comparing the published data to find where the hosts diverge.\n"}}
